{
  "info": {
    "name": "Donaciones Seguras — API",
    "description": "Pruebas del API (design.md §4). Usar con el entorno `local` (npm run dev) o con el del stage desplegado. Cada request cita los criterios HU/CA/T que verifica.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "publishedProjectId",
      "value": "7a91d0c4-2e5f-4b38-a6c7-1d9e8f2b4a63"
    },
    {
      "key": "draftProjectId",
      "value": "e8d4b6a2-5c3f-4e19-b7a0-9f1c2d3e4b58"
    },
    {
      "key": "missingProjectId",
      "value": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000"
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.test('Respuesta JSON', () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('content-type')).to.include('application/json'));",
          "pm.test('Los errores usan { code, message, requestId }', () => {",
          "  if (pm.response.code >= 400) pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.all.keys('code', 'message', 'requestId');",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Proyectos (público)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "T01 — Listar proyectos publicados",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/projects",
            "description": "T01 · CA-01.1 · CA-01.2: 200 y sin borradores."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('items es un arreglo', () => pm.expect(body.items).to.be.an('array'));",
                  "pm.test('Solo proyectos PUBLICADO (CA-01.2)', () => body.items.forEach((p) => pm.expect(p.status).to.eql('PUBLICADO')));",
                  "pm.test('El borrador no aparece', () => pm.expect(body.items.map((p) => p.projectId)).to.not.include(pm.collectionVariables.get('draftProjectId')));",
                  "pm.test('Montos en céntimos enteros y PEN', () => body.items.forEach((p) => {",
                  "  pm.expect(Number.isInteger(p.goalAmountCents)).to.be.true;",
                  "  pm.expect(Number.isInteger(p.confirmedAmountCents)).to.be.true;",
                  "  pm.expect(p.currency).to.eql('PEN');",
                  "}));",
                  "pm.test('Sin datos de donantes (CA-09.2)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include('donorSub'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "HU-02 — Detalle de proyecto publicado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/projects/{{publishedProjectId}}",
            "description": "CA-02.1: identificador, descripción, objetivo, estado y monto acumulado."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Campos públicos esperados', () => pm.expect(body).to.have.all.keys('projectId', 'title', 'description', 'goalAmountCents', 'confirmedAmountCents', 'currency', 'status'));",
                  "pm.test('Es el proyecto pedido', () => pm.expect(body.projectId).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('publishedProjectId')));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "CA-02.2 — Detalle de un BORRADOR → 404",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/projects/{{draftProjectId}}",
            "description": "Un proyecto no publicado devuelve 404 sin revelar contenido."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('404 Not Found', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));",
                  "pm.test('Código NOT_FOUND', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql('NOT_FOUND'));",
                  "pm.test('No revela el contenido del borrador', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include('Biblioteca'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "CA-02.2 — Detalle de proyecto inexistente → 404",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/projects/{{missingProjectId}}"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('404 Not Found', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));",
                  "pm.test('Código NOT_FOUND', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql('NOT_FOUND'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "CA-02.2 — Identificador mal formado → 404",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/projects/no-es-un-uuid"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test('404 Not Found', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "HU-09 — Indicadores de un proyecto publicado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/projects/{{publishedProjectId}}/stats",
            "description": "CA-09.1 · CA-09.2: solo cifras agregadas confirmadas."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Solo cifras agregadas', () => pm.expect(body).to.have.all.keys('projectId', 'goalAmountCents', 'confirmedAmountCents', 'currency', 'progressPercent'));",
                  "pm.test('Avance entre 0 y 100', () => pm.expect(body.progressPercent).to.be.within(0, 100));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "HU-09 — Indicadores de un BORRADOR → 404",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/projects/{{draftProjectId}}/stats"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test('404 Not Found', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Donaciones (protegido)",
      "description": "Rutas que exigen un access token de Cognito. Para obtenerlo: abrir «HU-07 — Historial propio», pestaña Authorization → Get New Access Token (Authorization Code con PKCE). Requiere las variables cognitoDomain y cognitoClientId del entorno.",
      "auth": {
        "type": "oauth2",
        "oauth2": [
          {
            "key": "grant_type",
            "value": "authorization_code_with_pkce",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "key": "authUrl",
            "value": "{{cognitoDomain}}/oauth2/authorize",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "key": "accessTokenUrl",
            "value": "{{cognitoDomain}}/oauth2/token",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "key": "clientId",
            "value": "{{cognitoClientId}}",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "key": "scope",
            "value": "openid email api/donations.read api/donations.write",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "key": "redirect_uri",
            "value": "https://oauth.pstmn.io/v1/callback",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "key": "useBrowser",
            "value": true,
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          {
            "key": "challengeAlgorithm",
            "value": "S256",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "key": "client_authentication",
            "value": "body",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "key": "tokenName",
            "value": "cognito-donante",
            "type": "string"
          },
          {
            "key": "addTokenTo",
            "value": "header",
            "type": "string"
          }
        ]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "T02 — Sin token → 401",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/donations/me",
            "description": "T02 · CA-03.2: una ruta protegida sin token responde 401."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('401 Unauthorized (T02)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test('Formato nativo de API Gateway (no llega a Lambda)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('message'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "T11 — Token alterado → 401",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer eyJraWQiOiJ4IiwiYWxnIjoiUlMyNTYifQ.eyJzdWIiOiJhdGFjYW50ZSIsInRva2VuX3VzZSI6ImFjY2VzcyIsInNjb3BlIjoiYXBpL2RvbmF0aW9ucy5yZWFkIn0.firma-alterada"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/donations/me",
            "description": "T11 · CA-03.2 · CA-NF02.1: un token con firma inválida responde 401."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('401 Unauthorized (T11)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test('Formato nativo de API Gateway (no llega a Lambda)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('message'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "T11 — ID token como Bearer → rechazado",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{idToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/donations/me",
            "description": "T11 · CA-03.2: copiar el id_token obtenido con el login en la variable idToken del entorno. HTTP API responde 403 porque el ID token no tiene scopes (decisión D4); el requisito pide 401. Documentar el código real."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('El ID token no da acceso (401 o 403, ver D4)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([401, 403]));",
                  "pm.test('No devuelve datos', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include('items'));",
                  "console.log('T11 con ID token respondió', pm.response.code);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "HU-07 — Historial propio con access token",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/donations/me",
            "description": "CA-07.1 · CA-04.3: con un access token de un usuario DONANTE responde 200 y solo sus donaciones. Con un usuario GESTOR responde 403 (CA-04.2, T12)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('items es un arreglo', () => pm.expect(body.items).to.be.an('array'));",
                  "pm.test('No repite donorSub', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include('donorSub'));",
                  "pm.test('Montos en céntimos enteros', () => body.items.forEach((d) => pm.expect(Number.isInteger(d.amountCents)).to.be.true));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
